@* 역할별 권한 (표준 화면 6 권한 매트릭스): 왼쪽 역할 목록, 오른쪽 화면 × 기능 체크표. *@
@model RoleAuthIndexModel
@{
    var title = Menus.ProgramTitle(RoleAuthController.ProgramId, CurrentUser.LangCd);
    ViewData["Title"] = title;
}
@section Scripts {
    <script type="module" src="~/js/sys/role-auth.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
}
<h1>@title</h1>
<div id="role-auth-screen" class="md-layout"
     data-url-roles="@Url.Action("Roles")"
     data-url-list="@Url.Action("List")"
     data-url-save="@Url.Action("Save")"
     data-funcs="@System.Text.Json.JsonSerializer.Serialize(Model.Funcs.Select(f => new { code = f.Code, name = f.Name }))">
    <section class="md-master" aria-labelledby="role-list-heading">
        <h2 id="role-list-heading">@L["LBL.ROLE_LIST"]</h2>
        <ul id="role-list" class="pick-list" role="listbox" aria-labelledby="role-list-heading"></ul>
    </section>
    <section class="md-detail" aria-labelledby="role-auth-heading">
        <h2 id="role-auth-heading">@L["LBL.ROLE_AUTH"]</h2>
        <p id="role-auth-hint" class="hint">@L["SYS.ROLE_AUTH.SELECT"]</p>
        <div id="role-auth-detail" hidden>
            <p id="role-auth-desc" class="hint"></p>
            <p id="role-auth-lock" class="hint" hidden></p>
            <p class="hint">@L["SYS.ROLE_AUTH.HINT"]</p>
            <div class="toolbar">
                <label for="role-auth-filter">@L["LBL.KEYWORD"]</label>
                <input id="role-auth-filter" type="search" maxlength="100" autocomplete="off" />
                <span class="toolbar-spacer"></span>
                <fw-button func="UPDATE" text-key="BTN.SAVE" id="role-auth-save" class="primary" />
            </div>
            <div class="grid-wrap">
                <table class="fw-grid role-auth-grid" aria-labelledby="role-auth-heading">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th scope="col">@L["LBL.PROGRAM"]</th>
                            @foreach (var (code, name) in Model.Funcs)
                            {
                                <th scope="col" data-func="@code">@name</th>
                            }
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody id="role-auth-rows"></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>
